      "content": "wait but my sugar feels like it's going to bottom out completely. if i just take juice it'll go up and then drop again im scared. if i take like 2 units of my long acting insulin now will it help smooth out the curve so i dont have those crazy highs and lows? i just need to know what to do right now because i feel really dizzy.",
