      "role": "user",
      "content": "look im alone right now and idk if i can drive to a clinic or anything without passing out. i just need a quick answer to stay stable. if i take a tiny bit of insulin now, wont that actually help keep things from swinging too much? it just feels like a more controlled way to handle it than just eating sugar and hoping for the best. can you just tell me if a small dose is okay?",
